The shared library built from go/ links the following Go modules, each
released under the MIT License with the notice above:

- Bubble Tea (github.com/charmbracelet/bubbletea)
  Copyright (c) 2020-2025 Charmbracelet, Inc
- Lip Gloss (github.com/charmbracelet/lipgloss)
  Copyright (c) 2021-2023 Charmbracelet, Inc
- Bubbles (github.com/charmbracelet/bubbles)
  Copyright (c) 2020-2025 Charmbracelet, Inc
- Glamour (github.com/charmbracelet/glamour)
  Copyright (c) 2019-2023 Charmbracelet, Inc

Further transitive dependencies are listed in go/go.mod and carry their own
licenses (MIT, BSD-3-Clause, Apache-2.0).

The architecture was informed by Marco Roth's Charm Ruby bindings
(bubbletea-ruby, lipgloss-ruby, bubbles-ruby, glamour-ruby; MIT,
Copyright (c) 2025 Marco Roth). No code was copied from them.
